------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Python (CPython 3.12)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

These files are Rust translations of parts of CPython's standard library:

  crates/codegraph-engine/src/py_fnmatch.rs   Lib/fnmatch.py (translate)
  crates/codegraph-engine/src/py_shlex.rs     Lib/shlex.py (shlex)
  crates/codegraph-engine/src/py_unparse.rs   Lib/ast.py (_Unparser)
  crates/codegraph-engine/src/py_json.rs      Lib/json/decoder.py and scanner.py
  crates/codegraph-store/src/semantic_vector.rs  Modules/mathmodule.c (math_fsum)

Summary of changes: translated from Python and C to Rust, limited to the behaviour the
engine needs, with the same accepted input, results and error text.

