2. PyYAML
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

crates/codegraph-engine/src/architecture/yaml.rs follows PyYAML's composer and
parser grammar (lib/yaml/composer.py and lib/yaml/parser.py), built on the
scanner of the yaml-rust2 crate.

